armbian-firstrun-gui (0.1.7) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Quick setup: one screen asks for the username and the password. Time
    zone, language, keyboard, shell and the full name are under Customize.
  * "@user" in the username field fills in the account from GitHub: name,
    username, profile picture, public SSH keys and the armbian-dotfiles
    repository. "@user@host" uses another server.
  * No network: the Wi-Fi page has the keyboard choice before the password.
  * After a successful setup without a display manager, tty1 shows the login
    prompt again.

 -- Armbian <info@armbian.com>  Tue, 24 Nov 2026 12:00:00 +0100

